    'name' => 'MEMO CX16 Magnetic Mobile Cooler | Semiconductor Cooling Fan for Gaming',
    'slug' => 'memo-cx16-magnetic-mobile-cooler-semiconductor-cooling-fan-for-gaming',
    'description' => '<h3 data-path-to-node="3"><b data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="0">Key Features</b></h3>\\n<ul data-path-to-node="4">\\n 	<li>\\n<p data-path-to-node="4,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="4,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Advanced Semiconductor Cooling:</b> Utilizing a high-performance Peltier module, the CX16 actively pulls heat away from your phone’s CPU, reducing temperatures by <b data-path-to-node="4,0,0" data-index-in-node="159">8–12°C</b> in minutes.</p>\\n</li>\\n 	<li>\\n<p data-path-to-node="4,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="4,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Strong Magnetic Adsorption:</b> Featuring a full circle of powerful magnets, it snaps instantly and securely onto the back of your phone. Compatible with MagSafe devices (iPhone 12 and newer) and includes a magnetic sticker for Android devices.</p>\\n</li>\\n 	<li>\\n<p data-path-to-node="4,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="4,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">Intelligent AI Temperature Control:</b> Built-in smart sensors monitor your device\'s heat in real-time, preventing condensation while maintaining optimal cooling efficiency.</p>\\n</li>\\n 	<li>\\n<p data-path-to-node="4,3,0"><b data-path-to-node="4,3,0" data-index-in-node="0">Ultra-Quiet Operation:</b> The high-speed silent fan operates with minimal vibration and noise, allowing you to keep your mic open and communicate with your squad without any background hum.</p>\\n</li>\\n 	<li>\\n<p data-path-to-node="4,4,0"><b data-path-to-node="4,4,0" data-index-in-node="0">Dynamic RGB Lighting:</b> Enhance your gaming setup with built-in colorful RGB effects that provide a professional, high-tech aesthetic.</p>\\n</li>\\n 	<li>\\n<p data-path-to-node="4,5,0"><b data-path-to-node="4,5,0" data-index-in-node="0">Lightweight &amp; Compact:</b> Designed to be non-intrusive, it won\'t block your grip or interfere with side buttons, keeping your hands comfortable during intense clutches.</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>',
    'short_description' => 'Elevate your gaming performance with the <b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="41">MEMO CX16 Magnetic Mobile Cooler</b>. Engineered specifically for high-intensity gaming like <b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="130">PUBG Mobile, Free Fire, and Genshin Impact</b>, this cooler eliminates thermal throttling, ensuring stable frame rates and a lag-free experience even during marathon sessions.',
