ta-path-to-node="4,4,0" data-index-in-node="0">Dynamic RGB "Gamer" Lighting:</b><span class="citation-36 citation-end-36"> Features a vibrant, multi-color RGB light ring that pulses during operation, adding a professional aesthetic to your gaming setup.</span></p>\\n\\n<div class="source-inline-chip-container ng-star-inserted"></div></li>\\n 	<li>\\n<p id="p-rc_0f05c280860ccc44-44" data-path-to-node="4,5,0"><b data-path-to-node="4,5,0" data-index-in-node="0"><span class="citation-35">Whisper-Quiet Hydraulic Fan:</span></b><span class="citation-35 citation-end-35"> The high-speed fan operates at low decibels, so it won’t interfere with your in-game voice chat or streaming audio.</span></p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>',
    'short_description' => 'Take your mobile gaming to the next level with the <b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="51">MEMO CX19 Magnetic Phone Cooler</b>. <span class="citation-41">Designed for high-performance devices, this flagship cooler combines aggressive cooling power with a sleek </span><b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="191"><span class="citation-41">Digital Temperature Display</span></b><span class="citation-41 citation-end-41">, ensuring you always know exactly how cold your phone is during intense PUBG or Genshin Impact sessions.</span>',
