  array (
    'name' => 'M66 4K Ultra HD Retro Game Stick',
    'slug' => 'm66-4k-ultra-hd-retro-game-stick',
    'description' => '<h3 data-path-to-node="11">Relive the Golden Era of Gaming with the M66 4K Retro Game Stick</h3>\\n<p data-path-to-node="12">Step away from modern subscription services and jump straight back into the classics. The <b data-path-to-node="12" data-index-in-node="90">M66 4K Mini Arcade Game Stick</b> is a powerful multimedia console designed to transform any modern TV, monitor, or projector into a classic retro arcade. Running on a stable, open-source Linux-based architecture, it offers flawless emulation with zero hassle.</p>\\n\\n<h3 data-path-to-node="13">Key Features &amp; Benefits</h3>\\n<ul data-path-to-node="14">\\n 	<li>\\n<p data-path-to-node="14,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="14,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Over 20,000+ Preloaded Games:</b> Never worry about finding or downloading files. The included high-speed memory card comes pre-packed with thousands of legendary games. From iconic arcade fighters to action-packed platformers, you have decades of entertainment right out of the box.</p>\\n</li>\\n 	<li>\\n<p data-path-to-node="14,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="14,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Crystal Clear 4K HDMI Output:</b> Don\'t let blurry retro graphics ruin the fun. The M66 features an internal scaling engine that outputs crisp high definition via HDMI. Enjoy vibrant, lag-free gameplay on large home screens.</p>\\n</li>\\n 	<li>\\n<p data-path-to-node="14,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="14,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">Dual Wireless Controllers:</b> Cut the cords! The M66 package includes two ergonomically designed wireless controllers running on a reliable 2.4GHz frequency. Play comfortably from your couch up to 8 meters away with high responsiveness and precise D-pad accuracy.</p>\\n</li>\\n 	<li>\\n<p data-path-to-node="14,3,0"><b data-path-to-node="14,3,0" data-index-in-node="0">Built-in Save/Load Progress:</b> Unlike old-school arcade machines, you won\'t lose your progress when you turn off the TV. The intuitive interface allows you to save your game state instantly at any point and reload exactly where you left off.</p>\\n\\n<h3 data-path-to-node="20">What\'s Inside the Box?</h3>\\n<ul data-path-to-node="21">\\n 	<li>\\n<p data-path-to-node="21,0,0">1 x M66 Retro Game Stick Console</p>\\n</li>\\n 	<li>\\n<p data-path-to-node="21,1,0">1 x 64GB MicroSD Card (Pre-installed)</p>\\n</li>\\n 	<li>\\n<p data-path-to-node="21,2,0">2 x 2.4GHz Wireless Gamepads</p>\\n</li>\\n 	<li>\\n<p data-path-to-node="21,3,0">1 x USB Wireless Receiver</p>\\n</li>\\n 	<li>\\n<p data-path-to-node="21,4,0">1 x HDMI Extension Cable</p>\\n</li>\\n 	<li>\\n<p data-path-to-node="21,5,0">1 x USB Power Cable</p>\\n</li>\\n 	<li>\\n<p data-path-to-node="21,6,0">1 x User Manual</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n<h3 data-path-to-node="22">How to Setup (Plug &amp; Play)</h3>\\n<ol start="1" data-path-to-node="23">\\n 	<li>\\n<p data-path-to-node="23,0,0">Insert the <b data-path-to-node="23,0,0" data-index-in-node="11">USB Wireless Receiver</b> into the Game Stick.</p>\\n</li>\\n 	<li>\\n<p data-path-to-node="23,1,0">Connect the <b data-path-to-node="23,1,0" data-index-in-node="12">USB Power Cable</b> to the Game Stick and plug the other end into a TV USB port or wall phone charger adapter.</p>\\n</li>\\n 	<li>\\n<p data-path-to-node="23,2,0">Plug the Game Stick into your TV’s <b data-path-to-node="23,2,0" data-index-in-node="35">HDMI port</b>.</p>\\n</li>\\n 	<li>\\n<p data-path-to-node="23,3,0">Turn on your TV, switch to the correct HDMI input channel, insert batteries into your controllers, and enjoy!</p>\\n</li>\\n</ol>\\n</li>\\n</ul>',
    'short_description' => '<p data-path-to-node="5"><b data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="0">Retro Arcade Nostalgia—Plug, Play, and Relive the Classics!</b></p>\\n<p data-path-to-node="6">Bring back the ultimate childhood memories with the <b data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="52">M66 4K Ultra HD Retro Game Stick</b>! This compact, pocket-sized console plugs directly into your TV’s HDMI port, instantly giving you access to a massive library of <b data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="214">20,000+ classic games</b> across legendary emulators like PS1, PSP, N64, MAME, GBA, and Sega Genesis.</p>\\n\\n<ul data-path-to-node="7">\\n 	<li>\\n<p data-path-to-node="7,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Massive Storage:</b> Preloaded with thousands of classic titles—no internet, setup, or downloads required.</p>\\n</li>\\n 	<li>\\n<p data-path-to-node="7,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Dual Wireless Controllers:</b> Includes two 2.4GHz lag-free wireless gamepads for seamless 2-player multiplayer action.</p>\\n</li>\\n 	<li>\\n<p data-path-to-node="7,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">4K Ultra HD Output:</b> Experience your childhood favorites upscaled for modern high-definition TVs, monitors, and projectors.</p>\\n</li>\\n 	<li>\\n<p data-path-to-node="7,3,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,3,0" data-index-in-node="0">Pure Plug &amp; Play Simplicity:</b> No complex tech skills needed. Just plug in, choose your game, and start playing!</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>',
