    'description' => '<p data-path-to-node="5"><b data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="0">Play 30,000+ Retro Classics Instantly with Transparent Wireless Controllers!</b></p>\\n<p id="p-rc_ef6587d89bd8a9b3-77" data-path-to-node="6">Take a massive leap in retro gaming with the <b data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="45">GS5 Mini 4K Ultra HD Retro Game Stick</b>! <span class="citation-125">Upgraded with an elite chip supporting a jaw-dropping </span><b data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="138"><span class="citation-125">53+ built-in emulators</span></b><span class="citation-125">, this plug-and-play TV stick packs over </span><b data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="201"><span class="citation-125">30,000 classic games</span></b><span class="citation-125 citation-end-125"> straight into a pocket-sized device.</span> No setup, no internet, and no massive console clutter required.</p>\\n\\n<ul data-path-to-node="7">\\n 	<li>\\n<p id="p-rc_ef6587d89bd8a9b3-78" data-path-to-node="7,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"><span class="citation-124">Massive 64GB Retro Vault:</span></b><span class="citation-124 citation-end-124"> Pre-loaded with 30,000+ timeless titles—from arcade heavyweights to 3D classics (including PS1, PSP, N64, MAME, Game Boy, and Sega).</span></p>\\n</li>\\n 	<li>\\n<p id="p-rc_ef6587d89bd8a9b3-79" data-path-to-node="7,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,1,0" data-index-in-node="0"><span class="citation-123">Premium Transparent Controllers:</span></b><span class="citation-123 citation-end-123"> Features two ultra-cool, ergonomic 2.4GHz transparent wireless gamepads for responsive, lag-free multiplayer fun.</span></p>\\n</li>\\n 	<li>\\n<p id="p-rc_ef6587d89bd8a9b3-80" data-path-to-node="7,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,2,0" data-index-in-node="0"><span class="citation-122">4K Ultra HD Streaming Output:</span></b><span class="citation-122 citation-end-122"> Automatically scales up your childhood favorites to look sharp and vibrant on modern 4K smart TVs, monitors, or projectors.</span></p>\\n</li>\\n 	<li>\\n<p data-path-to-node="7,3,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,3,0" data-index-in-node="0">Simple Plug &amp; Play OS:</b> Intuitive menus make it incredibly easy to search for games, save your progress instantly, and jump right back in!</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>',
    'short_description' => '<h3 data-path-to-node="11">The Ultimate Retro Arcade Powerhouse: GS5 Mini 4K Game Stick</h3>\\n<p id="p-rc_ef6587d89bd8a9b3-81" data-path-to-node="12">Forget about buying multiple retro systems or looking for complex game files. <span class="citation-121">The </span><b data-path-to-node="12" data-index-in-node="82"><span class="citation-121">GS5 Mini 4K Retro Game Stick</span></b><span class="citation-121"> is a next-generation plug-and-play console loaded with an unprecedented </span><b data-path-to-node="12" data-index-in-node="183"><span class="citation-121">53+ emulators</span></b><span class="citation-121 citation-end-121">.</span> Experience seamless, high-FPS retro gaming featuring everything from early 8-bit generation hits up to demanding 3D games—all running beautifully on an optimized, open-source architecture.</p>\\n\\n<h3 data-path-to-node="14">Key Features &amp; Benefits</h3>\\n<ul data-path-to-node="15">\\n 	<li>\\n<p id="p-rc_ef6587d89bd8a9b3-82" data-path-to-node="15,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="15,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Unrivaled 30,000+ Built-In Game Library:</b> Loaded to the absolute max. Explore an endless collection of platformers, fighters, sports, racing, and arcade games from the 80s, 90s, and 2000s. <span class="citation-120 citation-end-120">Includes high-performance emulation for demanding platforms like PSP, PlayStation 1, and Nintendo 64.</span></p>\\n</li>\\n 	<li>\\n<p data-path-to-node="15,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="15,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Next-Level Transparent Gamepads:</b> Stand out with premium, see-through 2.4GHz wireless controllers. Built with high-accuracy 3D joysticks and highly tactile buttons, they ensure zero signal interference or input lag from up to 10 meters away.</p>\\n</li>\\n 	<li>\\n<p data-path-to-node="15,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="15,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">Vibrant 4K HD Visual Scaling:</b> Don\'t watch pixelated retro graphics look stretched out on a modern TV. The integrated GS5 upscaling engine processes the retro data stream in real-time to deliver crisp, bright output via HDMI.</p>\\n</li>\\n 	<li>\\n<p data-path-to-node="15,3,0"><b data-path-to-node="15,3,0" data-index-in-node="0">Instant Save/Load &amp; Game Search:</b> The user-friendly interface allows you to create an easy "Favorites" list, search any game by name in seconds, and save your progress at any exact moment so you never lose a high score again.</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>',
