    'description' => '<p id="p-rc_5424bc2f2728e6f1-111" data-path-to-node="5"><b data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="0"><span class="citation-209 citation-end-209">2-in-1 Portable Handheld &amp; TV Retro Console with 20,000+ Classic Games!</span></b></p>\\n<p id="p-rc_5424bc2f2728e6f1-112" data-path-to-node="6">Experience the best of both worlds with the <b data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="44">SF3500 5.0-Inch Retro Handheld Game Console</b>. <span class="citation-208">Featuring a stunning, high-definition eye-protection screen, this powerful portable system comes pre-loaded with over </span><b data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="207"><span class="citation-208">20,000 retro classics</span></b><span class="citation-208"> across </span><b data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="236"><span class="citation-208">14+ built-in emulators</span></b><span class="citation-208 citation-end-208">.</span> <span class="citation-207 citation-end-207">Play anywhere on the go, or use the built-in HDMI port to connect it to your TV for instant big-screen arcade action!</span></p>\\n\\n<ul data-path-to-node="7">\\n 	<li>\\n<p id="p-rc_5424bc2f2728e6f1-113" data-path-to-node="7,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"><span class="citation-206">Vibrant 5.0-Inch IPS Screen:</span></b><span class="citation-206 citation-end-206"> Enjoy crisp 854x480 resolution with enhanced color saturation and smart brightness control.</span></p>\\n</li>\\n 	<li>\\n<p id="p-rc_5424bc2f2728e6f1-114" data-path-to-node="7,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,1,0" data-index-in-node="0"><span class="citation-205">FHD TV Output via HDMI:</span></b><span class="citation-205 citation-end-205"> Plug directly into your TV or monitor to transform it into a home gaming system.</span></p>\\n</li>\\n 	<li>\\n<p id="p-rc_5424bc2f2728e6f1-115" data-path-to-node="7,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,2,0" data-index-in-node="0"><span class="citation-204">Massive 64GB Retro Library:</span></b><span class="citation-204 citation-end-204"> Pre-loaded with 20,000+ nostalgic games across systems like PlayStation, MAME, Game Boy, and Sega Genesis.</span></p>\\n</li>\\n 	<li>\\n<p id="p-rc_5424bc2f2728e6f1-116" data-path-to-node="7,3,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,3,0" data-index-in-node="0"><span class="citation-203 citation-end-203">Long-Lasting 3000mAh Battery:</span></b><span class="citation-202 citation-end-202"> Get up to 4–6 hours of continuous, uncompromised gaming on a single charge with Type-C fast charging.</span></p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>',
    'short_description' => '<h3 data-path-to-node="11">Pocket Arcade Powerhouse: SF3500 Dual-Mode Retro Console</h3>\\n<p id="p-rc_5424bc2f2728e6f1-117" data-path-to-node="12">Relive your favorite childhood memories wherever you go. <span class="citation-201">The </span><b data-path-to-node="12" data-index-in-node="61"><span class="citation-201">SF3500 Retro Handheld Gaming Console</span></b><span class="citation-201 citation-end-201"> runs on an optimized open-source Linux system powered by an efficient Dual-Core processor.</span> <span class="citation-200 citation-end-200">It eliminates the control lag found in cheaper consoles, ensuring fluid gameplay for classic 8-bit, 16-bit, and 32-bit generations.</span></p>\\n<p id="p-rc_5424bc2f2728e6f1-118" data-path-to-node="13"><span class="citation-199 citation-end-199">Beyond its capability as a premium handheld player featuring an ergonomic 360° non-slip joystick, the SF3500 supports external wireless controller expansion and direct HDMI out—making it a perfect standalone multimedia gaming hub for your home entertainment setup.</span></p>\\n\\n<h3 data-path-to-node="15">Key Features &amp; Benefits</h3>\\n<ul data-path-to-node="16">\\n 	<li>\\n<p id="p-rc_5424bc2f2728e6f1-119" data-path-to-node="16,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="16,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">20,000+ Games &amp; 14 Emulators Pre-Loaded:</b> Skip the complicated setups and file downloads. The included high-speed 64GB microSD card gives you instant access to decades of arcade, fighting, racing, and platforming classics. <span class="citation-198 citation-end-198">Fully emulates legendary platforms including PS1, MAME, FC, SFC, MD, GB, GBC, GBA, and more.</span></p>\\n</li>\\n 	<li>\\n<p id="p-rc_5424bc2f2728e6f1-120" data-path-to-node="16,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="16,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Premium 5.0" Eye-Protection Display:</b><span class="citation-197 citation-end-197"> The large 5.0-inch IPS high-definition screen utilizes a private mold design to increase color saturation by 50%.</span> <span class="citation-196 citation-end-196">It offers exceptional clarity while protecting your eyes during long gaming sessions.</span></p>\\n</li>\\n 	<li>\\n<p id="p-rc_5424bc2f2728e6f1-121" data-path-to-node="16,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="16,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">Seamless HDMI TV Connection:</b> Want to share the fun? <span class="citation-195 citation-end-195">Connect the SF3500 to any modern smart TV or monitor using an HDMI cable to enjoy clean, lag-free Full HD upscaled output on the big screen.</span></p>\\n</li>\\n 	<li>\\n<p id="p-rc_5424bc2f2728e6f1-122" data-path-to-node="16,3,0"><b data-path-to-node="16,3,0" data-index-in-node="0">All-in-One Multimedia Terminal:</b> It’s more than just a gaming console. <span class="citation-194 citation-end-194">The SF3500 features native support for video playback, music listening, photo viewing, and smart e-book reading (TXT format) with background music capability.</span></p>\\n</li>\\n 	<li>\\n<p id="p-rc_5424bc2f2728e6f1-123" data-path-to-node="16,4,0"><b data-path-to-node="16,4,0" data-index-in-node="0"><span class="citation-193">Built to Last:</span></b><span class="citation-193 citation-end-193"> Built with a stylish, piano-lacquered premium ABS body, ergonomic textured crystal buttons, and precision 3D joysticks meant to withstand daily travel and heavy use.</span></p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>',
